<title>USA: Cantel Industries Inc Q4 full results.</title>
<headline>Cantel Industries Inc Q4 full results.</headline>
<dateline>CLIFTON, N.J. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							  July 31,</p>
<p>						   1996	    1995 (1)</p>
<p> Net sales				  $8,353,000    $10,727,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss)			   412,000	(884,000)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per common share	   0.10	   (0.23)</p>
<p> Average number of shares		4,334,000	3,777,000</p>
<p>							 Year Ended</p>
<p>							  July 31,</p>
<p>						   1996 (1)	1995 (1)</p>
<p> Net sales				  29,792,000     34,125,000</p>
<p>Net income (loss) before one-time</p>
<p>costs associated with the merger (2)</p>
<p>						   908,000	(793,000)</p>
<p> Net income (loss)			   422,000	(793,000)</p>
<p>Earnings (loss) per common share before</p>
<p>one-time costs associated with the</p>
<p>  merger (2)					0.21	   (0.21)</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per common share	   0.10	   (0.21)</p>
<p> Average number of shares		4,309,000	3,739,000</p>
<p>Note:</p>
<p>(1) Restated for MediVators merger which was treated as a pooling of interests.</p>
<p>(2) Costs associated with MediVators merger which was treated as a pooling of interests. SOURCE: Cantel Industries, Inc.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
